From 5c9f7b0a527932a9a994bf6d5608df9fa8d5d1b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:12:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-102: the properties list opens on the grid alone;
 the DFM list and the HTML folded, the same look (0.102.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

WPF keeps what is not the everyday property grid behind an expander ("advanced
properties by selecting a down arrow"). Here the .dfm's whole list and the HTML
part were always open under the grid, in another table style, with notes under
them. Now:
- "DFM 屬性" and "HTML" are folded until opened (DEFAULT_CLOSED; the user's own
  open / fold is remembered as before; a search still opens the ones it finds
  something in, and folds them back after);
- every name | value table has the grid's name column (38 %, one line, where the
  grid's names start), the DFM categories and the HTML parts are the grid's
  category bands; the notes under them are their headings' tooltips.

Tests (all 4 layers pass: lib 161, smoke 186, panels, real VS Code 159):
panels (the sort / search / HTML edit checks unchanged, all pass); screenshot
checked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
